## Code / libraries
- three.js r170 (MIT), served from the Lemo-Opuscar library (/root/lemo-opuscar/node_modules/three);
  post-processing core/three/post.js (MSAA, physical depth of field, vignette/grade) and core/lib.js easing from the
  Lemo-Opuscar library; frame renderer core/render (playwright). tools/frames.mjs and tools/stills.mjs copied from
  ../../lemo/dp_maps. index.html, tools/prep.mjs, tools/ocean.py, tools/sound.py, render.sh written for this clip.

